                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='11'>Task Hours: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='11'>#Qty of </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='11'>hours</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='11'> spent on tracked tasks - picking, packing and cycle counting</run>
